  CVE-2026-25083|2026-03-16T14:18:18.177|2026-03-16T14:53:07.390|8.7|HIGH|CWE-862|N/A|false|GROWI OpenAI thread/message API endpoints do not perform authorization. Affected are v7.4.5 and earlier versions. A logged-in user who knows a shared AI assistant's identifier may view and/or tamper the other user's threads/messages.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-25083
