  CVE-2019-25530|2026-03-12T16:16:06.827|2026-03-12T21:07:53.427|8.8|HIGH|CWE-89|N/A|false|uHotelBooking System contains an SQL injection vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to manipulate database queries by injecting SQL code through the system_page GET parameter. Attackers can send crafted requests to index.php with malicious system_page values using time-based blind SQL injection techniques to extract sensitive database information.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2019-25530
