  CVE-2026-3929|2026-03-11T22:16:35.557|2026-03-13T15:41:23.897|3.1|LOW|CWE-1300|N/A|false|Side-channel information leakage in ResourceTiming in Google Chrome prior to 146.0.7680.71 allowed a remote attacker to leak cross-origin data via a crafted HTML page. (Chromium security severity: Medium)|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-3929
