  CVE-2026-3757|2026-03-08T19:16:00.500|2026-03-09T16:31:44.413|6.9|MEDIUM|CWE-74|N/A|false|A security flaw has been discovered in projectworlds Online Art Gallery Shop 1.0. Affected by this vulnerability is an unknown functionality of the file /?pass=1. The manipulation of the argument fnm results in sql injection. The attack may be launched remotely. The exploit has been released to the public and may be used for attacks.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-3757
