  CVE-2025-68555|2026-03-05T06:16:12.120|2026-03-05T19:38:53.383|9.9|CRITICAL|CWE-434|N/A|false|Unrestricted Upload of File with Dangerous Type vulnerability in zozothemes Nutrie nutrie allows Upload a Web Shell to a Web Server.This issue affects Nutrie: from n/a through < 2.0.1.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-68555
  CVE-2025-68554|2026-03-05T06:16:11.983|2026-03-10T18:18:00.520|9.9|CRITICAL|CWE-434|N/A|false|Unrestricted Upload of File with Dangerous Type vulnerability in zozothemes Keenarch keenarch allows Using Malicious Files.This issue affects Keenarch: from n/a through < 2.0.1.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-68554
