  CVE-2026-20441|2026-03-02T09:16:17.447|2026-03-03T13:02:46.403|6.7|MEDIUM|CWE-787|N/A|false|In MAE, there is a possible out of bounds write due to a missing bounds check. This could lead to local escalation of privilege if a malicious actor has already obtained the System privilege. User interaction is not needed for exploitation. Patch ID: ALPS10432500; Issue ID: MSV-5803.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-20441
